sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as API Gateway
  participant L as Ask Lambda
  participant D as DynamoDB
  participant S as S3 (vectors)
  participant M as Bedrock
  B->>A: POST /ask (JWT)
  A->>A: verify JWT (Cognito)
  A->>L: invoke (userId from claims)
  L->>D: load last turns (chat memory)
  L->>M: rewrite follow-up to standalone query
  L->>M: embed query (Titan V2)
  L->>S: load user's vector files (cached when warm)
  L->>L: hybrid search = vector + BM25 -> RRF -> MMR
  L->>M: generate grounded answer (Claude Converse)
  L->>D: save messages + session
  L-->>B: answer + citations + confidence
